ORIGIN AND MODIFICATIONS
========================

Hermit is a modified version of Moonlight-qt (Moonlight PC), copyright Cameron Gutman and the
Moonlight contributors, which is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3 and
declared as GPL-3.0-or-later ("GPL-3.0+") in its AppStream metadata.
  https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-qt

Hermit is based on Moonlight-qt as of commit 8369d1a0e11b999d4d1598f62ca5f6dea49602fb
(September 2026). Juno Park modified it in 2026. The main changes are: the Hermit name, icon,
theme and Korean translation; clipboard sync of text, images and files; a settings panel over the
stream; live and automatic bitrate on Shell hosts; remote shutdown and restart of Shell hosts;
automatic reconnect; connection profiles; a configurable performance overlay; session summaries
and history; a single-file executable; and the removal of the online services operated by the
Moonlight project (update check, host compatibility list, connection test, gamepad mapping
updates, Discord integration). Changes inside files inherited from Moonlight-qt are generally
marked with comments that start with "Hermit:". This repository does not carry Moonlight-qt's
version history.

Notes for readers of the source:
- "Upstream" in comments means Moonlight-qt, and "upstream issue #N" refers to the Moonlight-qt
  issue tracker (https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-qt/issues).
- On its first run, if it has no settings yet, Hermit copies the settings of an installed
  Moonlight client once (paired hosts, client identity, preferences); see copyMoonlightSettings()
  in app/main.cpp.
- The STUN server used to find the external address of the local network is stun.cloudflare.com
  (see app/backend/computermanager.cpp).


