Obtaining the source code
-------------------------

The complete corresponding source code of Hermit is available at
https://github.com/junopark00/hermit, at the tag of each release. The source of the libraries
above is available at the locations given for each. If any of these sources is no longer
available there, Juno Park will provide the corresponding source code of a Hermit binary release,
including the libraries it contains, on request for at least three years after that release, at no
charge beyond the cost of providing it. Ask through an issue at
https://github.com/junopark00/hermit/issues.


